journey-sector-kel-terus = Kel Terus
journey-sector-kel-terus-description = Deep blue haze. Dense asteroid belts; long-haul refuelling stops are common here.

journey-sector-golden-veil = Golden Veil
journey-sector-golden-veil-description = Gold crystal fields heavy with wealth; pirate hulls patrol the mining lanes between them.

journey-sector-howling-choir = Howling Choir
journey-sector-howling-choir-description = A pulsar beats time over dead relays. The grid flickers in rhythm; charge what you can between blackouts.

journey-sector-quiet-harvest = Quiet Harvest
journey-sector-quiet-harvest-description = A cold field of dead hulls, drifting slow. Salvage crews welcome; something else lives in the wrecks.

journey-sector-glass-sermon = Glass Sermon
journey-sector-glass-sermon-description = A quasar too bright to read and too empty to matter. Nothing here but light and your own noise.

journey-sector-sporefall = Sporefall
journey-sector-sporefall-description = A blooming garden system. Spores on the wind, teeth in the dark. Do not let it aboard.

journey-sector-hollow-vigil = Hollow Vigil
journey-sector-hollow-vigil-description = A sector where the veil is thin. The dead do not rest here; keep the lights on.
